  <reporting-org ref="GB-CHC-285776" type="21">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NCA Darfur Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the lives of IDPs and host communities in South and West Darfur and to build the capacity of the three national partner organisations.  This will prepare for an eventual transition to recovery.   Activities are organised in six sectors: water and sanitation; health and nutrition; emergency preparedness and response; peace-building; agriculture and school support.  There will also be an emphasis on the mainstreaming of HIV and gender.  The project will also support new, short-term increases in emergency response.  The headquarters of the operation are in Nyala but the field coordinators are given delegated levels of responsibility for the work implemented in their areas (Zalingei and Garsilla).</narrative>
  </description>
